[TEXT] Found it. The FORWARD chain on **router6** has DROP rules for ALL traffic ingressing on `eth2` (the WAN uplink from router3):

```
iifname "eth2" meta l4proto tcp counter → DROP
iifname "eth2" meta l4proto udp counter → DROP  
iifname "eth2" counter (ICMP/other) 24 pkts/2016 bytes → DROP
